{"posts":[{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_1","t":"I read in the Ignored levels educational material that a FL needs to hit it's target to be considered a FL. This is the only place I've seen it written so far. If I'm understanding this correctly, this is another A-ha moment for me. Up to this point I've found FL difficult because I haven't been able to identify the good ones versus the bad ones.\n\n1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#1","p":1,"im":["d40eb1234fb30e82bac20afea0fc54288f3f0586"],"m":1},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_2","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#2","p":1,"im":["4415a1a396aeb6e0b7b6acae0e7baa22a3b49980"],"m":2},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_3","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#3","p":1,"im":["9e4aa40064ea5c81213ab3a4d432837d199f31af"],"m":3},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_4","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#4","p":1,"im":["524eca82cc4c88dbe42f15339f8644fb84276920"],"m":4},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_5","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#5","p":1,"im":["524eca82cc4c88dbe42f15339f8644fb84276920"],"m":5},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_6","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#6","p":1,"im":["9615b709f5207f16be94033f23997682d33b326a"],"m":6},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_7","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#7","p":1,"im":["292b85c64e9a53948e60847d4e1856d32263c8a0"],"m":7},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_8","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#8","p":1,"im":["5986374172ef48d0701f3c588dbb032562877a10","3e4c8dab07bd2ba3506f064982332f947c7e870a"],"m":8},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_9","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#9","p":1,"im":["4a88cc0b10d2f0ce6fb68e11cc1049548c9d65dd","1705a79d64cee53893d914db0e6d5d7148878699","045fd7178b9505311873dd46e310d1911adbe27b"],"m":9},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_10","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#10","p":1,"im":["2f448f544002058214a379dd0d58753527b87b8f","761433ff580ab13ce442298059fc1f9bb2587f09"],"m":10},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_11","t":"This isn't my chart. It is Salivan's chart from here. I think this is a great chart example for FL, engulf and showing how we can trade the CAPs once IT show their intentions.\n\n1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#11","p":1,"im":["5974abe22eddb3de54a3a1b792a9533c8e8d4cc9"],"m":11},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_12","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#12","p":1,"im":["22d1a196f248138d8e4bd29e53ebba6ceaf483ac","5b7d50ad7790d76865fad0fafffcbadba639db8f","4e4301e13ef6b38c1f73de2f97553a689f625435","efe477c7eee80c6134dc3973b355ceeb697737a3"],"m":12},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_13","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#13","p":1,"im":["a4c38deb3902ede0d9345e7f9aae0dd88fc933c6","33b6d816efa5f696de82b956949a350b4579cde2","c952f019abf448fc1ff951ec5856e0a6d2b6d86a","eabf0562ff486cbe2359e14a3ace9aea9a8ef577","2140f87a7a7f59ecdd3ccd085db9d80b640e25c0","b3e304f4d64956356bb879c24be433443201f432"],"m":13},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_14","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#14","p":1,"im":["f8f7cf7d1e9486b6374e95397f577cfebed0b638","c5ff0db1d266d433914e5e74206d65a60ce64ca6","1d020fbe38748bd523f01e9f4131d00b52ee0307","641dd35e06cad7794da44e4203f55be74ddbe8c4","282a52dad63c8989fb8bb9f749550c2d0f2ac5cd"],"m":14},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_15","t":"This chart had lost of good action that was understandable for me. Exciting stuff!\n\n1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#15","p":1,"im":["af25fe1f111a2c8857f7abf6c2642fe61d86a9f5"],"m":15},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_16","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#16","p":1,"im":["c1a6283f6fccf86be2315f71226a88aad597b7a6"],"m":16},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_17","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#17","p":1,"im":["a05d2904c59f108885b158a1457f591e52a1ce5c"],"m":17},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_18","t":"2144\n\nI think u might have noticed this, but in case haven't, hopefully it can give another perspective. There are also some other different lenses. but, i could be wrong","a":"—","d":"","n":"#18","p":1,"im":["fb13d521c416595cc1a1e64461d14c8655d8dba1"],"m":18},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_19","t":"It's promotion time\n\nWasher\n\nfind\n\n14517","a":"—","d":"","n":"#19","p":1,"im":[],"m":19},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_20","t":"zee\n\nCongrats Rinehart! Very very solid trading! Well deserved!","a":"—","d":"","n":"#20","p":1,"im":[],"m":20},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_21","t":"Thank you IF!","a":"—","d":"","n":"#21","p":1,"im":[],"m":21},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_22","t":"staurum wrote: I think u might have noticed this, but in case haven't, hopefully it can give another perspective. There are also some other different lenses. but, i could be wrong\n\nHere is my deeper analysis to address what you wrote Staurum. Thank you for keeping my brain working!\n\n1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#22","p":1,"im":["f70ecbbf35428b055d68f77b9f0a49f03fc0f511"],"m":22},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_23","t":"1016","a":"—","d":"","n":"#23","p":1,"im":["d7a55a417a6e0ea820b38ca99a4471eb03b34a36"],"m":23},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_24","t":"hi Rinehart, nice work here, you're thousand miles ahead of me when it comes to applying FL! A quick one, regarding this statement:\"FL needs to hit it's target to be considered a FL', I have a question: Must the target be another FL? or it can be an SR, a SD zone, a DP, a CAP?\n\nThanks man! AK.\n\nI don't quit","a":"—","d":"","n":"#24","p":1,"im":[],"m":24},{"id":"rinehartfl_p1_25","t":"Astrokillah wrote: hi Rinehart, nice work here, you're thousand miles ahead of me when it comes to applying FL! A quick one, regarding this statement:\"FL needs to hit it's target to be considered a FL', I have a question: Must the target be another FL? or it can be an SR, a SD zone, a DP, a CAP?\n\nThanks man! AK.\n\n1016\n\nHi Astrokillah, Thank you for your kind words. I too found (still sometimes find) FLs to be the most confusing part of RTM. But of course they are also the most important part, lol. Back in the past IF talked about FL, FTR, DPs, etc. But now we reference all of them as FL because people get hung up on the terminology.\n\nIt is our job to identify the good FLs. The ones that were formed from breaking a significant barrier like S/R or a past FL of significance (or sometimes the ones that preceded the breaking of the significant level--DPs). If we accept that all these DPs, FTR, FL,etc can all be called FLs. Then the only other thing is what is in between the FLs which are the PAZs. So the market is really just FL, PAZ, FL, PAZ, FL, PAZ, FL.\n\nTo answer your question: we don't know a FL is a FL until it crosses the PAZ to the next FL and touches it. SR by itself is not a target (although it is normally formed off a past FL. If price reaches a DP of significance (lead to a break of S/R) then I would call that DP a FL and say that price hit its target. If price hits a CAP, that CAP normally forms off a previous FL and I would say that price hit its target.\n\nThe times we don't consider price to have hit a target are times when price breaks a FL but doesn't completely cross the PAZ. These are your engulfs, FOs, BSZ, etc. These are great because these are the markers that indicate it is time to start looking for trades. Other times, price will for example engulf a FL and pull back a lot and then eventually push to the target. These are the times were you end up with a much bigger FL.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#25","p":1,"im":[],"m":25}],"images":[{"k":"d40eb1234fb30e82bac20afea0fc54288f3f0586","t":"assets/thumbs/d40eb1234fb30e82bac20afea0fc54288f3f0586.webp","f":"assets/images/d40eb1234fb30e82bac20afea0fc54288f3f0586.png","w":1500,"h":797,"b":134255,"o":"d40eb1234fb30e82bac20afea0fc54288f3f0586.png","p":1,"pid":"rinehartfl_p1_1"},{"k":"4415a1a396aeb6e0b7b6acae0e7baa22a3b49980","t":"assets/thumbs/4415a1a396aeb6e0b7b6acae0e7baa22a3b49980.webp","f":"assets/images/4415a1a396aeb6e0b7b6acae0e7baa22a3b49980.png","w":1500,"h":801,"b":120523,"o":"4415a1a396aeb6e0b7b6acae0e7baa22a3b49980.png","p":1,"pid":"rinehartfl_p1_2"},{"k":"9e4aa40064ea5c81213ab3a4d432837d199f31af","t":"assets/thumbs/9e4aa40064ea5c81213ab3a4d432837d199f31af.webp","f":"assets/images/9e4aa40064ea5c81213ab3a4d432837d199f31af.png","w":1500,"h":794,"b":120945,"o":"9e4aa40064ea5c81213ab3a4d432837d199f31af.png","p":1,"pid":"rinehartfl_p1_3"},{"k":"524eca82cc4c88dbe42f15339f8644fb84276920","t":"assets/thumbs/524eca82cc4c88dbe42f15339f8644fb84276920.webp"